    "overview": "<p>Drawing veterans from the Com Guards, recruits from the Free Worlds League, and volunteers from Protectorate worlds, the Word of Blake Militia assembled infantry formations whose quality varied but whose equipment was consistently first-rate. Operating medium-caliber ultra autocannon that can fire at double the normal rate, these crews deliver concentrated salvos that overwhelm light armor and suppress infantry positions, accepting increased jam risk for burst damage.</p>"
